1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:10,600
(VERSE 1)

2
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:12,686
Golden hour on the avenue,

3
00:00:12,926 --> 00:00:15,080
your shadow dances before I do.

4
00:00:15,798 --> 00:00:17,553
Heartbeat drums in the heat,

5
00:00:17,553 --> 00:00:20,027
I lose the ground beneath my feet.

6
00:00:20,265 --> 00:00:24,096
You say slow down — I say why?

7
00:00:25,371 --> 00:00:27,686
The music's burning, we can fly.

8
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,000
(CHORUS)

9
00:00:29,121 --> 00:00:31,196
Sway like fire, move that way,

10
00:00:31,596 --> 00:00:33,590
let the rhythm take my name.

11
00:00:33,909 --> 00:00:35,904
Light me up, don't let it fade,

12
00:00:36,463 --> 00:00:38,856
we were born to sway like fire.

13
00:00:39,095 --> 00:00:43,963
Sway like fire (hey-oh-oh),

14
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:47,633
sway like fire (hey-oh-oh).

15
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:48,500
(VERSE 2)

16
00:00:48,909 --> 00:00:50,904
City lights on the Caribbean skin,

17
00:00:51,542 --> 00:00:53,137
every spark pulls me in.

18
00:00:53,616 --> 00:00:55,612
Say you're done, but we know that lie,

19
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:58,005
heat like this don't say goodbye.

20
00:00:58,005 --> 00:00:59,840
Hands up, hearts wild,

21
00:01:00,238 --> 00:01:02,234
we glow for a little while.

22
00:01:02,314 --> 00:01:04,388
One more beat 'til the stars retire,

23
00:01:04,548 --> 00:01:07,500
we don't burn out — we sway like fire.

24
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,300
(CHORUS)

25
00:01:09,495 --> 00:01:11,649
Sway like fire, move that way,

26
00:01:11,968 --> 00:01:14,121
let the rhythm take my name.

27
00:01:14,281 --> 00:01:16,516
Light me up, don't let it fade,

28
00:01:16,676 --> 00:01:19,468
we were born to sway like fire.

29
00:01:19,706 --> 00:01:23,378
Sway like fire (hey-oh-oh),

30
00:01:24,415 --> 00:01:29,680
sway like fire (hey-oh-oh).
